    "path": "migration-guides/README.md",
    "content": "# Migration Guides\n\nUse this workflow when a user wants to migrate from another payment provider to Pine Labs.\n\n## Routing\n\n- Razorpay: read `migration-guides/razorpay.md`.\n- Cashfree: read `migration-guides/cashfree.md`.\n- PayU: read `migration-guides/payu.md`.\n- Juspay: read `migration-guides/juspay.md`.\n- CCAvenue: read `migration-guides/ccavenue.md`.\n\n## Migration Rules\n\n1. Identify the current payment flow: order, hosted checkout, payment link, refund, subscription, payout, or webhook.\n2. Map concepts to Pine Labs API areas before writing code.\n3. Replace old-provider SDK calls with Pine Labs SDK/REST calls; do not copy old-provider request signing or webhook verification snippets.\n4. Keep Pine Labs credentials server-side and default examples to UAT.\n5. Run validation-and-testing before go-live.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nUse UAT credentials stored server-side, an enabled Pine Labs merchant profile, and the referenced API-area guide before changing an integration.\n\n## Happy Path\n\nExecute the documented backend flow, record the merchant reference and Pine Labs identifiers, and verify final status server-side.\n\n## Failure Path\n\nPreserve the original merchant reference and idempotency key, query the backend state, and present pending, failed, cancelled, and replayed outcomes separately.\n\n## Security Constraints\n\nKeep client secrets, access tokens, card data, OTPs, bank data, and customer PII out of browser/mobile code, prompts, logs, and command arguments.\n\n## Diagnostics\n\nCollect redacted request IDs, merchant references, Pine Labs IDs, webhook IDs, and final backend status before escalating.\n\n## Release Evidence\n\nRecord UAT scenarios, expected and observed status, webhook verification evidence, retry behavior, owner, and rollback decision.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [Pine Labs Quick Start](https://www.pinelabs.com/docs/online-payments/quick-start-guide) (Verified: 2026-08-19)\n- [Pine Labs Checkout API](https://www.pinelabs.com/docs/online-payments/api/checkout) (Verified: 2026-08-19)\n- [Pine Labs Orders API](https://www.pinelabs.com/docs/online-payments/api/orders) (Verified: 2026-08-19)\n- [Pine Labs Webhook Signature Verification](https://www.pinelabs.com/docs/online-payments/developer-tools/webhooks/signature-verification) (Verified: 2026-08-19)\n"
