    "content": "# Checkout\n\nOpenAPI version: `3.0`  \nSpec hash: `sha256:032c753ae331bbdab36e338b3bf3dab5a482380f6029fd72f795f7dd02bdbb24`\n\n## When To Use\n\nBuild hosted checkout and redirect-based payment flows.\n\n## Best Practice\n\nPrefer hosted checkout for fast web integrations and verify final status server-side.\n\n## Operations\n\n| Operation | Method | Path | Safety | API reference |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `GenerateCheckoutLink` | POST | `/api/checkout/v1/orders` | `live-money-movement` | [/api/checkout/generate-checkout-link](/api/checkout/generate-checkout-link) |\n\n## Shared Setup\n\nSet credentials server-side only:\n\n```bash\nexport PINELABS_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id\nexport PINELABS_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret\nexport PINELABS_ENV=uat\n```\n\n### TypeScript SDK Client\n\n```ts\nimport { PinelabsApiClient } from \"pinelabs-node\";\n\nconst baseUrl = \"https://pluraluat.v2.pinepg.in\";\nconst auth = new PinelabsApiClient({ baseUrl, token: \"\" });\nconst tokenResponse = await auth.authentication.generateToken({\n  grant_type: \"client_credentials\",\n  client_id: process.env.PINELABS_CLIENT_ID!,\n  client_secret: process.env.PINELABS_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n});\nconst client = new PinelabsApiClient({ baseUrl, token: tokenResponse.access_token });\n```\n\n### Python SDK Client\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom pinelabs import PinelabsApi\n\nbase_url = \"https://pluraluat.v2.pinepg.in\"\nauth = PinelabsApi(base_url=base_url, token=\"\")\ntoken_response = auth.authentication.generate_token(\n    grant_type=\"client_credentials\",\n    client_id=os.environ[\"PINELABS_CLIENT_ID\"],\n    client_secret=os.environ[\"PINELABS_CLIENT_SECRET\"],\n)\nclient = PinelabsApi(base_url=base_url, token=token_response.access_token)\n```\n\n### Agent Toolkit Setup\n\n```ts\nimport { Agent, run } from \"@openai/agents\";\nimport { PinelabsAgentToolkit, pinelabsEnvironment } from \"pinelabs-agent-toolkit/openai\";\n\nconst toolkit = new PinelabsAgentToolkit({\n  environment: pinelabsEnvironment.UAT,\n  clientId: process.env.PINELABS_CLIENT_ID!,\n  clientSecret: process.env.PINELABS_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n});\nconst agent = new Agent({\n  name: \"Pine Labs Integration Agent\",\n  instructions: \"Use Pine Labs APIs in UAT unless production is explicitly confirmed.\",\n  tools: await toolkit.getAgentTools(),\n});\n```\n\n## Operation Examples\n\n### Generate a Checkout Link API (`GenerateCheckoutLink`)\n\nGenerate an Infinity Checkout link. Returns a redirect URL where\n\nSafety: `live-money-movement` - Money-moving operation. Default to UAT, require explicit production confirmation, use idempotency/request IDs, and emit audit output.\n\n#### cURL\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \"https://pluraluat.v2.pinepg.in/api/checkout/v1/orders\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $PINELABS_ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Request-Timestamp: <Request-Timestamp>\" \\\n  -H \"Request-ID: <Request-ID>\" \\\n  -H \"Idempotency-Key: <unique-request-id>\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"merchant_order_reference\":\"112345\",\"order_amount\":{\"value\":50000,\"currency\":\"INR\"},\"integration_mode\":\"REDIRECT\",\"allowed_payment_methods\":[\"CARD\",\"UPI\"],\"notes\":\"Order1\",\"callback_url\":\"https://sample-callback-url\"}'\n```\n\n#### CLI\n\n```bash\npinelabs generate-checkout-link \\\n  --env uat \\\n  --idempotency-key <unique-request-id> \\\n  --json '{\"merchant_order_reference\":\"112345\",\"order_amount\":{\"value\":50000,\"currency\":\"INR\"},\"integration_mode\":\"REDIRECT\",\"allowed_payment_methods\":[\"CARD\",\"UPI\"],\"notes\":\"Order1\",\"callback_url\":\"https://sample-callback-url\"}'\n```\n\n#### TypeScript SDK\n\n```ts\nconst result = await client.checkout.generateCheckoutLink({\n  \"merchant_order_reference\": \"112345\",\n  \"order_amount\": {\n    \"value\": 50000,\n    \"currency\": \"INR\"\n  },\n  \"integration_mode\": \"REDIRECT\",\n  \"allowed_payment_methods\": [\n    \"CARD\",\n    \"UPI\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": \"Order1\",\n  \"callback_url\": \"https://sample-callback-url\"\n});\nfunction pineLabsResultSummary(result: unknown): Record<string, unknown> {\n  const value = result && typeof result === \"object\" ? (result as Record<string, unknown>) : {};\n  const data = value.data && typeof value.data === \"object\" ? (value.data as Record<string, unknown>) : {};\n  return {\n    id: value.id ?? value.order_id ?? value.payment_id ?? value.refund_id ?? data.id,\n    status: value.status ?? value.order_status ?? value.payment_status ?? data.status,\n    merchantReference: value.merchant_reference ?? value.merchant_order_reference,\n    expiresAt: value.expires_at,\n  };\n}\nconsole.log(pineLabsResultSummary(result));\n```\n\n#### Python SDK\n\n```python\nrequest = {\n  \"merchant_order_reference\": \"112345\",\n  \"order_amount\": {\n    \"value\": 50000,\n    \"currency\": \"INR\"\n  },\n  \"integration_mode\": \"REDIRECT\",\n  \"allowed_payment_methods\": [\n    \"CARD\",\n    \"UPI\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": \"Order1\",\n  \"callback_url\": \"https://sample-callback-url\"\n}\nresult = client.checkout.generate_checkout_link(**request)\nprint({\n    \"id\": getattr(result, \"id\", None) or getattr(result, \"order_id\", None) or getattr(result, \"payment_id\", None) or getattr(result, \"refund_id\", None),\n    \"status\": getattr(result, \"status\", None) or getattr(result, \"order_status\", None) or getattr(result, \"payment_status\", None),\n    \"merchant_reference\": getattr(result, \"merchant_reference\", None),\n})\n```\n\n#### Agent Toolkit Prompt\n\n```ts\nconst result = await run(agent, \"Use the Pine Labs GenerateCheckoutLink operation in UAT. Do not run in production unless I explicitly confirm it. Input JSON: {\\\"merchant_order_reference\\\":\\\"112345\\\",\\\"order_amount\\\":{\\\"value\\\":50000,\\\"currency\\\":\\\"INR\\\"},\\\"integration_mode\\\":\\\"REDIRECT\\\",\\\"allowed_payment_methods\\\":[\\\"CARD\\\",\\\"UPI\\\"],\\\"notes\\\":\\\"Order1\\\",\\\"callback_url\\\":\\\"https://sample-callback-url\\\"}\");\nconsole.log(\"Pine Labs operation completed. Log only redacted IDs and statuses from application state.\");\n```\n\n## Public URL\n\nThis reference is also generated at `/.well-known/skills/pinelabs-best-practices/references/checkout.md`.\n\n## Skill Routing\n\n- Domain router: `pg/README.md`\n- Domain reference index: `pg/references/REFERENCE.md`\n"
